# Logging Standards

## Overview
Structured logging standards, data redaction patterns, and context propagation.

## Log Levels
- Debug: Detailed debugging (development only)
- Info: General informational messages
- Warn: Warning messages
- Error: Error events with stack traces

## Structured Logging
**✅ CORRECT:**
```typescript
this.logger.log({
  message: 'Fetching user',
  userId,
  operation: 'getUser',
});
```

## Context Propagation
**✅ CORRECT:**
```typescript
this.logger.log({
  requestId: this.cls.get('requestId'),
  userId: this.cls.get('userId'),
});
```

## Data Redaction
**✅ CORRECT:**
```typescript
import { redactSensitiveData } from '@microservices-shared/logging';
this.logger.info('User login', {
  email: redactSensitiveData(user.email),
  password: '[REDACTED]',
});
```

